  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math><br /><br />Where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> is inductance of each part,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mtext>1.8</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>0.9</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mtext>0.9</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>0.45</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br /><br />Resistance of each part, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />&nbsp;</p><p>Time constant of circuit,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>0.45</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mtext>1.5</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>"
